        "created_at": "2017-12-10T15:31:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"NestorDRod\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nestordrod/48/2353_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> NestorDRod:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I just picked up my copy of the Starter Kit at a FLGS as an early birthday present to myself.I looked through the contents and didn't see any reference to obtaining a PDF copy.Am I SOL? Am I missing something? I'd like to run the game for my online group, but without digital material to give them, it's not very feasible.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If the retailer is part of the bits and mortar program, they can give you the PDF included as part of the purchase:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.bits-and-mortar.com/how-do-i-get-my-pdf/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.bits-and-mortar.com/how-do-i-get-my-pdf/</a></p>\n<p>If not, reach out to <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a>.&nbsp;</p>",
